{"format":1,"seq":836,"writes":[{"type":"entry","value":{"model":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm checking the keepRuns boundary logic and mutations that would break protection of answers and user messages, testing off-by-one errors in the runs length calculation and the assistant role/toolCallIds filtering condition.\n\nI realize user messages are protected by two independent guards—the role check and the toolCallIds length check—so no single mutation can break both at once, and the test would catch verbatim changes anyway. I'll stop trying to find a combined probe here and just report what I've found.\n\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_bdrk_01DWBv52SzwFX6cDVbXp1GJm","name":"typescript","arguments":{"code":"// @pit: {\"label\": \"Baseline and mutation probes on the keepRuns boundary and answer protection\"}\nasync ({ tests: { runTargeted, probeMutation } }) => {\n  const files = [\"test/durable/context-planning.test.ts\", \"test/durable/context.test.ts\"];\n  const baseline = await runTargeted({ files, raise: true });\n  if (!(\"counts\" in baseline) || !baseline.counts || baseline.counts.passed < 1) throw new Error(\"no baseline\");\n  const keep = await probeMutation({ label: \"keepRuns off by one\", owner: \"src/durable/context/collapse.ts\", before: \"runs.length - (settings.keepRuns - 1)\", after: \"runs.length - settings.keepRuns\", files });\n  const answers = await probeMutation({ label: \"answers become candidates\", owner: \"src/durable/context/collapse.ts\", before: `if (item.role !== \"assistant\" || item.toolCallIds.length === 0) return undefined;`, after: `if (item.role !== \"assistant\") return undefined;`, files });\n  const users = await probeMutation({ label: \"inputs no longer start runs\", owner: \"src/durable/context/collapse.ts\", before: `if (runs.length === 0 || (input && !afterInput)) runs.push([]);`, after: `if (runs.length === 0) runs.push([]);`, files });\n  const pick = (r: any) => ({ applied: r.mutationApplied, inconclusive: r.inconclusive, failed: r.report?.counts?.failed ?? r.counts?.failed, names: (r.report?.failures ?? r.failures ?? []).map((f: any) => f.name ?? f.test ?? f).slice(0, 6) });\n  return { baseline: baseline.counts, keep: pick(keep), answers: pick(answers), users: pick(users) };\n}","timeoutMs":300000}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"nvidia","model":"aws/anthropic/bedrock-claude-opus-5-5","usage":{"input":2,"output":1393,"cacheRead":179072,"cacheWrite":2552,"totalTokens":183019,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0,"totalFromProvider":false},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":701},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1794905336600,"responseId":"msg_bdrk_tiblar2b6y74naw3t5yejsyssq6xk2asznppnwegnic4dkosgtwa","rawStopReason":"tool_use","durationMs":14924,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}],"kind":"pi.assistant","id":233,"conversationId":1,"byTaskId":231}},{"type":"task","value":{"id":231,"conversationId":1,"kind":"pi.generation","version":2,"input":{},"background":false,"abortRequested":false,"state":{"status":"waiting","checkpoint":{"phase":"tools","assistant":233,"tools":[234],"pending":[]},"on":[234],"policy":"allSettled"},"startedAt":1794905336554}},{"type":"task","value":{"id":234,"conversationId":1,"kind":"pi.tool","version":3,"input":{"kind":"model","assistant":233,"callId":"toolu_bdrk_01DWBv52SzwFX6cDVbXp1GJm"},"owner":231,"background":false,"abortRequested":false,"state":{"status":"pending","checkpoint":{"phase":"call"}}}},{"type":"document.change","id":2,"content":{"version":3,"kind":"base","value":{"run":{"taskId":231,"inputs":[8],"turns":52,"first":7},"tools":[{"callId":"toolu_bdrk_01DWBv52SzwFX6cDVbXp1GJm","name":"typescript","taskId":234,"status":"pending"}]}}},{"type":"document.change","id":4,"content":{"version":1,"kind":"base","value":{"models":{"nvidia/aws/anthropic/bedrock-claude-opus-5-5":{"input":106,"output":73599,"cacheRead":6056391,"cacheWrite":355337,"totalTokens":6485433,"cost"